    "index_image_with_text_7rCz4j": {
      "type": "index__image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_4zTQ4x": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "heading_size": "regular",
            "text": "<p><strong>\"Knitting Love into Every Stitch—For This Generation and the Next\" <\/strong><\/p><p><strong>MIKA & MILO<\/strong> began with a simple belief: children’s knitwear should be as durable as it is delightful. Inspired by Mongolian cashmere herders and our founder’s own childhood hand-me-downs, we create heirloom-quality pieces designed to survive playground tumbles, washing machine cycles, and—most importantly—to be passed down with pride.<\/p><p>Every stitch is GOTS-certified organic, every seam ethically crafted, and every design tested by real kids because ‘it gives me super powers\" is our favorite compliment. Winner of 5 Junior Design Awards, including Best Children's Eco brand twice, <strong>MIKA & MILO<\/strong> is your kids' favourite new hand-me-downs. After all, surely our kids and the planet they will inherit deserve only the best. <\/p>",
            "alignment": "left",
            "vertical_position": "center",
            "button_label": "LEARN MORE",
            "link": "https:\/\/mika-milo.com\/pages\/awards",
