            "text": "<p>For over a century, the Stevenson family has been at the heart of the woollen industry. It all began with Herbert Stevenson, who ran a woollen mill on the outskirts of Edinburgh, making his own brand of Scottish tweeds. When Drummond joined the business, their Macnab tweeds were sold across Europe and the US.<\/p><p>Peter Stevenson then introduced cashmere to the mix, traveling to Inner Mongolia over 40 years ago to source the world's finest fibres. Today, we continue to work with the same trusted partners whilst being based in Hong Kong, blending tradition with innovation to create timeless pieces for the next generation.<\/p>",
            "alignment": "left",
            "vertical_position": "center",
            "button_label": "LEARN MORE",
